     @field toleranceFitInfo {ToleranceFitInfo} : @requiredIf {`toleranceType` is `FIT`, `FIT_WITH_TOLERANCE` or `FIT_TOLERANCE_ONLY`}
         Specifies the fit standard to be used for a hole or shaft
